{"id":"01a0657e-136c-720a-a50e-d6fc74a87f4e","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Experiments in Golems","paragraph":383,"wording":"[Golem Artificer]","event":"named"}
{"id":"01a0657e-136c-7229-b9df-1e96f508c080","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Experiments in Golems","paragraph":406,"wording":"[Golem Artificer]","event":"named","holderQuote":"Femithain interrupted the [Golem Artificer] after the sixth try. Nsiia caught her breath as the woman deflated—she actually had a fake eye, Nsiia noticed. It was stone and kept swiveling around in her head. Not at all creepy and why her apprentices were terrified of her, of course."}
